-- הסכם מיוחד (השלמה) מיום 12.9.95: the employers and ארגון המורים
-- בבתי הספר העל-יסודיים add sections to the collective agreement of
-- 31.8.94, under its §26.2 (Histadrut HaMorim's agreement went beyond its
-- cost): the salary tables take in תוספת 1993 and תוספת השהייה from
-- 1.1.94, and §3 of that agreement is cancelled (§א); a committee examines
-- the erosion check's formula, and the annex ה' table of 1996 applies from
-- 1.1.96 (§ב); the supreme parity committee's budget (§ג); the counselling
-- allowance (§ד); in-service allowance units (§ה); continuity of sick-pay
-- compensation and a sick-days fund (§§ו–ז); the committees and their
-- disputes (§ח); the side letter's matters (§ט); mothers in guidance
-- posts (§י); the early-retirement tracks (§יא); a loan fund for teachers
-- who are not State employees (§יב); the hardship fund (§יג); a
-- counsellor's allowance carried into teaching (§יד); and disputes (§טו).
-- Two letters on the early-retirement fund, a registration form and a
-- registration letter are annexed.
--
-- It amends l4/agreements/oz-latmura/1994-08-31_oz-latmura_wage-supplements-1994.l4
-- (imported). The Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.8.2011 measures the 2011
-- erosion supplement under it and the agreement of 11.5.93 (oz-founding-39)
-- and funds its §יב's loan fund again (oz-founding-50). It speaks to no pay
-- item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is not in oz-latmura-root.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `1994-08-31_oz-latmura_wage-supplements-1994`

§ `הסכם מיוחד (השלמה) — טבלאות שכר (12.9.1995)`

DECLARE `1995 Oz agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `examine changing the erosion check's formula`
    `prepare a sick-days fund agreement`
    `finish the committee's work by its set day`
    `decide the committees' disagreements`
    `discuss the disagreements over the early-retirement tracks`
    `set the rules of the loan fund`
    `set up the loan fund for teachers who are not State employees`
    `allocate a further million to the hardship fund`
    `decide disputes arising from the 1995 agreement`
    `act to apply the 1995 agreement to the owners' teaching employees`
    `announce that the early-retirement plan is not renewed`
    `negotiate the early-retirement plan`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The State of Israel, on the letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 A filing barcode; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The letterhead's Hebrew date (10 Sivan 5755); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The letterhead's date (8 June 1995), the draft's, not the signing's; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 A file number; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The registration stamp (no. 7080/95, its day left blank); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The State and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The organisation and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The organisation's short name; no rule.

-- ¶7: the title, its day written by hand (12.9.95).
@ref akn:preamble/p7
`the 1995 Oz agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 12 9 1995

-- ¶14: by the understandings reached, which §26.2 of the agreement of
-- 31.8.94 expresses (Histadrut HaMorim's changes beyond that agreement's
-- cost apply to it), the sections below are added to that agreement.
@ref akn:preamble/p14
`the 1995 Oz agreement's sections are added to the agreement of 31.8.94` MEANS
    `Histadrut HaMorim's changes apply under the 1994 Oz agreement` TRUE

§§ `א. טבלאות שכר`

-- akn:art_a The heading of §א.

-- 1.1: from 1.1.94 the teachers' salary tables ("the new combined
-- salary") include תוספת 1993 and תוספת השהייה, paid until then on a
-- line of their own, and those are no longer paid apart. That takes
-- nothing from the standing of the stay hours under the parties'
-- collective agreements.
@ref akn:art_a__para_1-1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1995 Oz tables include תוספת 1993 and תוספת השהייה on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994)

`the 1995 Oz agreement changes the standing of the stay hours` MEANS FALSE

-- 1.2: employees whose pay is linked to the teachers' tables and who were
-- not entitled to תוספת השהייה before have its rate (10%) offset from the
-- tables by the employers. F-oz-1995-a: "יקזזו ... את שיעור התוספת
-- מטבלאות השכר (10%)" takes 10% off the table, or takes out the supplement
-- 1.1 put into it at 10% of its own base. The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.consistent): the supplement comes out as 1.1 put it in, the
-- table divided by 110%.
@ref akn:art_a__para_1-2
`the rate of תוספת השהייה the 1995 Oz agreement offsets` MEANS 10%

GIVEN `the teachers' table amount` IS A NUMBER
      `entitled to תוספת השהייה before` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a linked employee's table amount under the 1995 Oz agreement` `the teachers' table amount` `entitled to תוספת השהייה before` IS
    IF `entitled to תוספת השהייה before`
    THEN `the teachers' table amount`
    ELSE `the teachers' table amount` DIVIDED BY (1 PLUS `the rate of תוספת השהייה the 1995 Oz agreement offsets`)

-- The words read as printed would take 10% of the table off.
GIVEN `the teachers' table amount` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a linked employee's table amount with 10% of the table taken off` `the teachers' table amount` IS
    `the teachers' table amount` MINUS `the rate of תוספת השהייה the 1995 Oz agreement offsets` TIMES `the teachers' table amount`

-- 1.3: §3 of the agreement of 31.8.94 is cancelled on this agreement's
-- signing (1.1 says the same, in the tables).
@ref akn:art_a__para_1-3
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§3 of the 1994 Oz agreement stands on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` `the 1995 Oz agreement was signed on`

§§ `ב. בדיקת שחיקה ומועד תשלום 1996`

-- akn:art_b The heading of §ב.

-- ב.1: a change in the erosion check's formula and mechanism, as the
-- collective agreement of 11.5.93 set them ("הסכם 93", outside the
-- corpus), is examined by a joint committee of the parties with Histadrut
-- HaMorim, on four proposals: a new spread of grades as the check's base,
-- checks against the base year 1993, freezing the 106 shekels (§6 of the
-- agreement of 31.8.94) at their value at the check, and taking the Beer
-- Sheva municipality out of the population checked. The section sets no
-- formula of its own: it puts the change to a committee (no deadline:
-- convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_b__para_1 akn:art_b__para_1/p2 akn:art_b__para_1__subpara_1 akn:art_b__para_1__subpara_2 akn:art_b__para_1__subpara_3 akn:art_b__para_1__subpara_4
DECLARE `proposal on the erosion check` IS ONE OF
    `a new spread of grades as the check's base`
    `checks by the base year 1993`
    `freezing the 106 shekels at their value at the check`
    `taking the Beer Sheva municipality out of the population checked`

`the proposals the 1995 Oz agreement puts to the erosion committee` MEANS
    LIST `a new spread of grades as the check's base`, `checks by the base year 1993`, `freezing the 106 shekels at their value at the check`, `taking the Beer Sheva municipality out of the population checked`

`the shekels the third proposal freezes` MEANS `the teaching-reinforcement supplement of 1.9.94`

`examining the erosion formula` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `examine changing the erosion check's formula`

`the 1995 Oz agreement sets an erosion formula of its own` MEANS FALSE

-- ב.2: payment by the annex ה' table, once it is adjusted to the erosion
-- check's results, applies retroactively from 1.1.96 (as §2.5's last
-- paragraph of the agreement of 31.8.94 says, and against its first
-- paragraph's 1.4.96: F-oz-1994-a). If the results are not delivered, the
-- annex ה' table is paid as an advance from the salary of March 1996,
-- whatever the results.
@ref akn:art_b__para_2 akn:art_b__para_2/p2
`the 1995 Oz agreement applies the annex ה' table from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1996

DECLARE `how the annex ה' table is paid in 1996` IS ONE OF
    `as adjusted to the erosion check, from 1.1.96`
    `unadjusted, as an advance from the salary of March 1996`

GIVEN `the check's results were delivered` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `how the annex ה' table is paid in 1996`
DECIDE `how the 1995 Oz agreement pays the annex ה' table` `the check's results were delivered` IS
    IF `the check's results were delivered`
    THEN `as adjusted to the erosion check, from 1.1.96`
    ELSE `unadjusted, as an advance from the salary of March 1996`

`the salary month the annex ה' advance is paid from` MEANS LIST 1996, 3

§§ `ג. ועדה פריטטית עליונה`

-- akn:art_c The heading of §ג.

-- A sum of 0.1% of the wage cost of the teaching employees is put at the
-- disposal of the supreme parity committee on the terms of service of
-- teaching employees of both organisations.
@ref akn:art_c/p1
`the share of the teachers' wage cost for the supreme parity committee` MEANS 0.1%

GIVEN `the teachers' wage cost` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the supreme parity committee's sum under the 1995 Oz agreement` `the teachers' wage cost` IS
    `the share of the teachers' wage cost for the supreme parity committee` TIMES `the teachers' wage cost`

§§ `ד. גמול יעוץ`

-- akn:art_d The heading of §ד.

-- The counselling allowance's rates are updated from 1.9.94 (convention
-- dates.start) by the year of seniority in counselling the counsellor is
-- in: the first, 5%; the second, 6%; the third, 7%; the fourth, 8%; the
-- fifth and on, 9%. The table counts years by their order ("שנת ותק
-- ראשון"), so a row is the year he is in (convention
-- thresholds.seniority).
@ref akn:art_d/p1 akn:art_d/t1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the year of counselling he is in` IS A NUMBER @desc one in the first year
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1995 Oz counselling allowance rate on` d `the year of counselling he is in` IS
    IF NOT d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994)
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (BRANCH
                  IF `the year of counselling he is in` `has reached the row from` 5 THEN 9%
                  IF `the year of counselling he is in` `has reached the row from` 4 THEN 8%
                  IF `the year of counselling he is in` `has reached the row from` 3 THEN 7%
                  IF `the year of counselling he is in` `has reached the row from` 2 THEN 6%
                  OTHERWISE 5%)

§§ `ה. גמולי השתלמות`

-- akn:art_e The heading of §ה.

-- Two more units of in-service allowance: the allowance's ceiling is 15
-- units in תשנ"ז and 16 in תשנ"ח (school years by the calendar year they
-- open in: convention dates.school-year).
@ref akn:art_e/p1
GIVEN `the school year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the in-service allowance ceiling the 1995 Oz agreement sets in` `the school year` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the school year` AT LEAST 1997 THEN JUST 16
        IF `the school year` EQUALS 1996 THEN JUST 15
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

`the in-service allowance units the 1995 Oz agreement adds` MEANS 2

§§ `ו–ז. ימי מחלה`

-- akn:art_f The heading of §ו.
-- akn:art_g The heading of §ז.

-- §ו: in addition to §13 of the agreement of 11.5.93 (outside the corpus),
-- the arrangement for the continuity of sick-pay compensation takes in
-- these owners: ORT Israel, Amal, Amit, Tadal-Emuna, Na'amat, WIZO, the
-- yeshivot and ulpanot linked to the Bnei Akiva yeshivot centre, the
-- seminars' associations, the Jewish Agency, the College of Management's
-- school network, the teachers' training colleges and the education
-- institutions companies. Adding more owners is discussed in the supreme
-- parity committee.
@ref akn:art_f/p1
`the owners the 1995 Oz agreement adds to the sick-pay continuity` MEANS
    LIST "אורט ישראל", "עמל", "אמי\"ת", "תאד\"ל-אמונה", "נעמת", "ויצו", "הישיבות והאולפנות הקשורות למרכז ישיבות בני עקיבא", "עמותות של סמינרים", "הסוכנות היהודית", "רשת בתי הספר של המכללה למינהל", "מיכללות להכשרת עו\"ה", "חברות מוסדות חינוך"

GIVEN `the owner` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1995 Oz agreement adds the owner to the sick-pay continuity` `the owner` IF
    elem `the owner` `the owners the 1995 Oz agreement adds to the sick-pay continuity`

-- §ז: a joint committee chaired by the head of the Ministry's terms of
-- service department prepares a proposed sick-days fund agreement for the
-- organisation's members, on the model of the collective agreement of
-- 24.1.89 (outside the corpus); no deadline (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_g/p1
`preparing a sick-days fund agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `prepare a sick-days fund agreement`

§§ `ח–ט. ועדות ומכתב הלוואי`

-- akn:art_h The heading of §ח.
-- akn:art_i The heading of §ט.

-- §ח ¶1: each committee set up under the agreement of 1993 or this one
-- finishes its work by the day set for it in advance (the day is each
-- committee's: a fact). ¶2: if the committees reach no decision, the
-- disagreements go to a parity committee of the wages commissioner, the
-- Ministry's director-general, the Centre of Local Government's
-- director-general and the organisation's representatives. ¶3: the
-- mechanisms the 1993 agreement set for the committees are not changed but
-- by agreement, for the period of the 1993–96 agreement.
@ref akn:art_h/p1
GIVEN `the days set for the committee's work` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1995 Oz agreement action`
DECIDE `a 1995 committee finishing its work` `the days set for the committee's work` IS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `finish the committee's work by its set day`
    WITHIN `the days set for the committee's work`

@ref akn:art_h/p2
GIVEN `the committee reached a decision` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1995 Oz agreement action`
DECIDE `deciding the committees' disagreements` `the committee reached a decision` IS
    IF `the committee reached a decision`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the parity committee`
         MUST  `decide the committees' disagreements`

@ref akn:art_h/p3
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `changed by agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 committee mechanisms stand on` d `changed by agreement` IF
        NOT `changed by agreement`
    AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1996)

-- §ט: the matters Mr. Y. Kochik raised in the side letter "מיום 31.8.94"
-- are not exhausted by this agreement; the parties go on dealing with them
-- apart. The side letter annexed to the agreement of 31.8.94, on the
-- matters that agreement did not exhaust, is dated 1 September 1994
-- (F-oz-1995-b); the reading adopted (convention reading.misprint): §ט
-- means that letter, and its three matters stay open.
@ref akn:art_i/p1
`the day §ט of the 1995 Oz agreement gives the side letter` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1994

`the side letter's matters the 1995 Oz agreement leaves open` MEANS `the matters the 1994 Oz agreement does not exhaust`

§§ `י. מורות אם בתפקידי הדרכה`

-- akn:art_j The heading of §י.

-- ¶1: a teaching employee who is the mother of a child up to the age of 14
-- (the 14th birthday ends it: convention thresholds.until), employed in
-- teaching and in guidance posts at 79% of a position or more in all, has
-- the mother's supplement, on a position of no more than 100%. ¶2: one the
-- Ministry asked to work beyond a position has the mother's supplement
-- beyond it, as usual, if her teaching is 50% of a position at least. The
-- supplement's own rate is the usual one, outside the corpus: the section
-- says on what position it is paid.
@ref akn:art_j/p1 akn:art_j/p2
`the position a mother in guidance needs under the 1995 Oz agreement` MEANS 79%
`the teaching a mother working beyond a position needs` MEANS 50%
`the age the 1995 Oz mother's supplement runs to` MEANS 14

GIVEN `the youngest child's age in whole years` IS A NUMBER
      `her position in teaching and guidance` IS A NUMBER
      `her position in teaching` IS A NUMBER
      `asked by the Ministry to work beyond a position` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position the 1995 Oz agreement pays a mother's supplement on` `the youngest child's age in whole years` `her position in teaching and guidance` `her position in teaching` `asked by the Ministry to work beyond a position` IS
    IF     `the youngest child's age in whole years` `is until` `the age the 1995 Oz mother's supplement runs to`
       AND `her position in teaching and guidance` AT LEAST `the position a mother in guidance needs under the 1995 Oz agreement`
    THEN IF `asked by the Ministry to work beyond a position` AND `her position in teaching` AT LEAST `the teaching a mother working beyond a position needs`
         THEN `her position in teaching and guidance`
         ELSE min `her position in teaching and guidance` 1
    ELSE 0

-- ¶3: teachers whose entitlement ended because the child passed 14 may
-- complete their position with teaching hours up to the pay they were in
-- fact paid, the mother's supplement included, and no more than a
-- position; in their own school as far as possible, with no undertaking.
@ref akn:art_j/p3
GIVEN `the pay she was in fact paid with the supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the pay of her position with the added hours` IS A NUMBER
      `her position with the added hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a former mother's completion is within the 1995 Oz agreement` `the pay she was in fact paid with the supplement` `the pay of her position with the added hours` `her position with the added hours` IF
        `the pay of her position with the added hours` AT MOST `the pay she was in fact paid with the supplement`
    AND `her position with the added hours` AT MOST 1

`the completion is in her own school as an undertaking` MEANS FALSE

§§ `יא. הסדרי מסלולי הפרישה`

-- akn:art_ja The heading of §יא.

-- ¶1: the quotas of the early-retirement tracks for teaching employees
-- (§28 of the agreement of 1993, outside the corpus) stand in the school
-- years תשנ"ה, תשנ"ו and תשנ"ז. The annexed letters say what the print
-- left out (below).
@ref akn:art_ja/p1
`the school years §יא keeps the early-retirement quotas in` MEANS LIST 1994, 1995, 1996

-- ¶2: a joint committee discusses the disagreements in applying §28 of the
-- 1993 agreement and sums up its conclusions by 31.12.94 — a day already
-- past when the agreement was signed: the section copies the
-- understandings of 1994 (¶14 of the preamble).
@ref akn:art_ja/p2
`the day §יא's committee concludes by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1994

`discussing the early-retirement disagreements` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `discuss the disagreements over the early-retirement tracks`

§§ `יב–יג. קרן הלוואות וקרן המצוקה`

-- akn:art_jb The heading of §יב.
-- akn:art_jc The heading of §יג.

-- §יב ¶1: following the negotiation and the agreement signed the same day,
-- a loan fund of 2 million shekels is set up for the organisation's
-- members who are teaching employees and not State employees, like the
-- arrangement for teaching employees in the State's service. ¶2: its rules
-- are set by representatives of the Treasury, the Ministry and the
-- organisation (set elsewhere). (The Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.8.2011,
-- §50, allocates it 4 million more.)
@ref akn:art_jb/p1
`the loan fund the 1995 Oz agreement sets up` MEANS 2_000_000

GIVEN `a member of the organisation` IS A BOOLEAN, `a State employee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may borrow from the 1995 Oz loan fund` `a member of the organisation` `a State employee` IF
    `a member of the organisation` AND NOT `a State employee`

`setting up the loan fund` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `set up the loan fund for teachers who are not State employees`

@ref akn:art_jb/p2
`setting the loan fund's rules` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `set the rules of the loan fund`

`why the loan fund's rules are not in §יב` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "נציגי משרד האוצר, משרד החינוך וארגון המורים: הכללים לביצוע קרן ההלוואות לפי סעיף יב. להסכם המיוחד (השלמה) מיום 12.9.95"

-- §יג: a further million shekels is allocated to the hardship fund.
@ref akn:art_jc/p1
`the further sum the 1995 Oz agreement allocates to the hardship fund` MEANS 1_000_000

`allocating the further million to the hardship fund` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `allocate a further million to the hardship fund`

§§ `יד. גרירת גמול תפקיד למורה יועץ`

-- akn:art_jd The heading of §יד.

-- ¶1: a counsellor who worked eight years at least in counselling and
-- stopped carries the counselling allowance with him, if one of the eight
-- was among the last seven years before he moved to teaching. ¶2: it is
-- not carried to a post of principal, deputy principal, guidance or
-- supervision, nor by one who moves to teach in a seminar or a college.
-- ¶3: a counsellor who returns to teaching after one of those posts has
-- the counselling allowance he was entitled to on the eve of his
-- appointment.
@ref akn:art_jd/p1 akn:art_jd/p2 akn:art_jd/p3
DECLARE `where the former counsellor goes` IS ONE OF
    `to teaching`
    `to a post of principal, deputy, guidance or supervision`
    `to teach in a seminar or a college`
    `back to teaching after such a post`

`the years in counselling the 1995 Oz agreement asks` MEANS 8
`the last years one of them must fall in` MEANS 7

GIVEN `years in counselling` IS A NUMBER
      `years in counselling among the last seven` IS A NUMBER
      w IS A `where the former counsellor goes`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `carries the counselling allowance under the 1995 Oz agreement` `years in counselling` `years in counselling among the last seven` w IF
        `years in counselling` AT LEAST `the years in counselling the 1995 Oz agreement asks`
    AND `years in counselling among the last seven` AT LEAST 1
    AND (   w EQUALS `to teaching`
         OR w EQUALS `back to teaching after such a post`)

§§ `טו. יישוב חילוקי דעות`

-- akn:art_if The heading of §טו.

-- ¶1: a parity follow-up committee — the wages commissioner and the
-- Ministry's director-general on one side, the local government, the three
-- large cities and the organisation's chair on the other — goes on
-- following and helping to carry out the agreement, and decides the
-- disputes arising from it (no deadline: convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_if/p1
`deciding disputes under the 1995 Oz agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `decide disputes arising from the 1995 agreement`

-- ¶2: the government acts to apply it to the teaching employees of the
-- "owners", whom it supervises and funds.
@ref akn:art_if/p2
`applying the 1995 agreement to the owners' teachers` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `act to apply the 1995 agreement to the owners' teaching employees`

