-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p17 The history: the agreement of 11.5.93 cancelled the employers' 0.7% to the early-retirement fund (קפ"מ).
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p18 The history: the State took on running the fund beside its own early-retirement track.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p21 A request for the addressee's written approval; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p22 The closing; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p23 A New Year's greeting; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p1 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p2 The signatory; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p3 A copy to the organisation's chair; no rule.

-- The first letter, ¶19–¶20: in §יא of the agreement of 12.9.95 the last
-- print dropped the word "ואילך" after "ותשנ"ז"; the addressee agreed that
-- the early-retirement tracks are not cancelled, and go on until the
-- parties agree otherwise. The second letter answers that the content is
-- acceptable "in principle" (below). §יא names the three years and is
-- silent after them; the letters say the tracks go on past them.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p19 akn:att_1__hc_1/p20
`the word the letter says the print of §יא dropped` MEANS "ואילך"

-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 The corpus's label for the second letter (the Finance Minister's chief of staff to the organisation, 20.9.1995); no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 The Finance Minister's office; no rule.
