§§ `illustrations`

#ASSERT `the 1995 Oz agreement's sections are added to the agreement of 31.8.94`
#ASSERT `the 1995 Oz tables include תוספת 1993 and תוספת השהייה on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994)
#ASSERT `§3 of the 1994 Oz agreement stands on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 11 9 1995)
#ASSERT NOT `§3 of the 1994 Oz agreement stands on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 12 9 1995)

-- §א.1.2: a table amount of 1,100 for one never entitled to the stay
-- supplement: 1,000 by the reading, 990 by the words taken as printed.
#ASSERT `a linked employee's table amount under the 1995 Oz agreement` 1100 FALSE EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `a linked employee's table amount under the 1995 Oz agreement` 1100 TRUE EQUALS 1100
`§א.1.2 takes the stay supplement out two ways` MEANS
    NOT `a linked employee's table amount under the 1995 Oz agreement` 1100 FALSE
        EQUALS `a linked employee's table amount with 10% of the table taken off` 1100
#ASSERT `§א.1.2 takes the stay supplement out two ways`

-- §ב: the 1.1.96 the agreement of 31.8.94 reads from its §2.5 (F-oz-1994-a).
#ASSERT `the 1995 Oz agreement applies the annex ה' table from` EQUALS `the day §2.5's last paragraph applies the annex ה' table from`
#ASSERT `the annex ה' table of the 1994 Oz agreement applies on` `the 1995 Oz agreement applies the annex ה' table from`
#ASSERT `how the 1995 Oz agreement pays the annex ה' table` FALSE EQUALS `unadjusted, as an advance from the salary of March 1996`
#ASSERT count `the proposals the 1995 Oz agreement puts to the erosion committee` EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the shekels the third proposal freezes` EQUALS 106

-- §ג: 0.1% of a wage cost of a billion.
#ASSERT `the supreme parity committee's sum under the 1995 Oz agreement` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS 1_000_000

-- §ד: the first year 5%, the third 7%, the sixth 9%.
#ASSERT `the 1995 Oz counselling allowance rate on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) 1 EQUALS JUST (5%)
#ASSERT `the 1995 Oz counselling allowance rate on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) 3 EQUALS JUST (7%)
#ASSERT `the 1995 Oz counselling allowance rate on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) 6 EQUALS JUST (9%)
#ASSERT `the 1995 Oz counselling allowance rate on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1994) 6 EQUALS NOTHING

-- §ה: 15 units in תשנ"ז, 16 in תשנ"ח.
#ASSERT `the in-service allowance ceiling the 1995 Oz agreement sets in` 1996 EQUALS JUST 15
#ASSERT `the in-service allowance ceiling the 1995 Oz agreement sets in` 1997 EQUALS JUST 16
#ASSERT `the in-service allowance ceiling the 1995 Oz agreement sets in` 1995 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the 1995 Oz agreement adds the owner to the sick-pay continuity` "ויצו"
#ASSERT NOT `the 1995 Oz agreement adds the owner to the sick-pay continuity` "רשת אחרת"

-- §י: a mother of a 10-year-old at 85% has the supplement on 85%; at 110%
-- not asked by the Ministry, on 100%; asked and teaching 60%, on 110%; at
-- 75%, or with a child of 14, none.
#ASSERT `the position the 1995 Oz agreement pays a mother's supplement on` 10 0.85 0.5 FALSE EQUALS 0.85
#ASSERT `the position the 1995 Oz agreement pays a mother's supplement on` 10 1.1 0.6 FALSE EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the position the 1995 Oz agreement pays a mother's supplement on` 10 1.1 0.6 TRUE EQUALS 1.1
#ASSERT `the position the 1995 Oz agreement pays a mother's supplement on` 10 1.1 0.4 TRUE EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the position the 1995 Oz agreement pays a mother's supplement on` 10 0.75 0.5 FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the position the 1995 Oz agreement pays a mother's supplement on` 14 0.85 0.5 FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `a former mother's completion is within the 1995 Oz agreement` 9000 8800 0.95
#ASSERT NOT `a former mother's completion is within the 1995 Oz agreement` 9000 9100 0.95

-- §יא and the letters: the tracks stand in תשנ"ח until non-renewal is
-- announced; §יא's committee's day had passed at the signing.
#ASSERT `the early-retirement tracks stand in` 1996 TRUE
#ASSERT `the early-retirement tracks stand in` 1997 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the early-retirement tracks stand in` 1997 TRUE
#ASSERT `the 1995 Oz agreement was signed on` `is on or after` `the day §יא's committee concludes by`

-- §יב: a member who is not a State employee may borrow.
#ASSERT `may borrow from the 1995 Oz loan fund` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `may borrow from the 1995 Oz loan fund` TRUE TRUE

-- §יד: eight years, one of them recent, to teaching; not to a principal's
-- post.
#ASSERT `carries the counselling allowance under the 1995 Oz agreement` 8 1 `to teaching`
#ASSERT NOT `carries the counselling allowance under the 1995 Oz agreement` 8 1 `to a post of principal, deputy, guidance or supervision`
#ASSERT NOT `carries the counselling allowance under the 1995 Oz agreement` 7 1 `to teaching`
#ASSERT NOT `carries the counselling allowance under the 1995 Oz agreement` 9 0 `to teaching`

-- F-oz-1995-b's evidence: §ט dates the side letter a day before the day
-- it prints, and its matters are that letter's three.
`§ט dates the side letter a day early` MEANS
        DATE_SERIAL `the 1994 Oz side letter is dated` MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the day §ט of the 1995 Oz agreement gives the side letter` EQUALS 1
    AND count `the side letter's matters the 1995 Oz agreement leaves open` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `§ט dates the side letter a day early`
